&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As Account Manager at Adyen, you will manage our largest enterprise merchants by building strong relationships with key merchant contacts. The ideal candidate is a born networker who thrives in a fast-paced, diverse and entrepreneurial environment. You&#39;ll be managing relationships with local and international merchants across multiple industries and channels, so life is never dull! You will understand the unique needs of a merchant and provide them with payments expertise and guidance to help them grow.&lt;/p&gt;
