&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have full professional proficiency (written and verbal) in English;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are available to work 3 days in person on Morumbi/SP.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
