&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a strategic, process-driven Senior Brand Enablement Manager to join our in-house creative team, the Studio.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will manage all resources that colleagues and external parties need to find and create on-brand assets. On the one hand, you own and maintain brand guidelines, design guidelines, and copy guidelines. On the other hand, you manage our collection of digital assets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With that, your mission is to enable any team, agency, or AI agent to produce on-brand content in an efficient way. You turn our brand, creative guidelines, and digital assets into a living, breathing ecosystem, through scaling workflows, managing resources, and keeping all relevant parties up to date.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role demands a high level of ownership, exceptional communication, organizational skills, and a forward-thinking approach to leveraging technology to scale operational efficiency. You’ll report to the Head of Content &amp;amp; Design and closely work with the Head of Global Brand via a crucial dotted line relationship. In your day to day, you’ll collaborate with the Global Marketing Department, and partner with Regional &amp;amp; Local marketing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brand Governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of all brand guidelines, rules &amp;amp; standards for Adyen’s creative output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enablement of guidelines through education, templatizing, and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous curation of guidelines, adapting to local needs, media trends, and developing technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First point of contact for inquiries regarding brand guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Asset Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Categorization and curation of all available creative assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revision of uploaded assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Answering DAM tooling related request from colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DAM user management for internal and external parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creative Infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revision of our creative tech stack in order to scale your solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Governance of our single sources of truth (guidelines &amp;amp; assets) from a tech enablement perspective; you make sure colleague’s agents and tools draw from right brand and creative sources&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 5+ years of experience in Creative Operations, Brand Operations, or Design Operations, ideally within an international B2B or corporate environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systemic Thinker: You don&#39;t just distribute guidelines; you build the infrastructure that makes following them the path of least resistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech &amp;amp; AI Savvy: Strong familiarity with modern creative tools, digital asset management tools, and a keen interest/experience in operationalizing AI tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matrix Navigation: Proven success working in a hybrid reporting structure, comfortably balancing execution metrics (Studio) with strategic alignment (Global Brand)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Core Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong (internal) customer focus and know how to strike a balance between upholding standards (quality) and meeting customer needs (speed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re familiar with creative processes and a have a knack for operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a change agent with a proven track record of rolling out new tools, DAM systems, or workflow processes across regional teams without friction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re data driven and whether it’s about tracking asset utilization, determining what guidelines need revision, or justifying an investment, you use figures for guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an educator at heart and you know how to influence, persuade and sell your solutions internally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re adaptable, resilient, and know how to solve challenges in ambiguous situations and complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
