&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Commercial Finance Business Partner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seeking a strategic thinker with 6+ years of experience in strategic or commercial finance, ideally within a high-growth fintech or technology environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate must possess exceptional analytical capability to translate complex data into actionable insights, while maintaining the strong commercial instinct needed to partner effectively with senior leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a unique balance of financial rigor and a pragmatic, entrepreneurial mindset to drive and scale commercial strategy in a dynamic landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong collaborative relationships with commercial leadership in the North America business to define and drive commercial and financial strategy, aligned with Adyen’s long-term growth drivers;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, full-funnel commercial performance analysis to assess growth drivers, strategic initiatives, go-to-market decisions, translating data into executive-level insights;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide critical challenge and thought partnership on high-impact commercial decisions, ensuring robust and balanced trade-off evaluation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead North America’s Commercial planning and goal setting by partnering with regional leaders to define, track, and review commercial goals across the funnel following the global methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in strategic finance, commercial finance, commercial insights, strategy consulting role or similar, ideally in high-growth, global technology or fintech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic and analytical thinker with the ability to seamlessly balance long-term strategic vision with effective short-term execution in a complex, dynamic and evolving business landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to operate as a senior business partner to commercial leadership, with strong commercial instinct and financial judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical capability, with a track record of simplifying complex data into clear, actionable insights for senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and influencing skills across senior, cross-functional, and multicultural teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, self-starting, collaborative and entrepreneurial, excited to build, shape, and scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL and BI tools such as Looker, Tableau, or Power BI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
