&lt;p&gt;The central goal of this role is to continue - and accelerate - our growth, while continuing to establish Adyen as a thought leader in payments and empowering a growing team to adapt Adyen’s global strategy to local needs. The ideal candidate is a natural leader and networker with a consultative and commercial mindset, who thrives in a fast-paced, diverse, and entrepreneurial environment. This candidate will be an integral contributor to shaping &amp;amp; driving Adyen Mexico’s strategy, aligning cross-functional teams and growing talent through fostering a healthy &amp;amp; collaborative team environment.&lt;/p&gt;
