&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspirational leadership&lt;/strong&gt; - Lead, empower, grow and support our local sales, account management, marketing and operations organization in Mexico, managing a team of managers and their teams focused on growing Adyen’s business with Mexico-based companies and collaborating with global merchants.&lt;/li&gt;
