&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upskill &amp;amp; develop&lt;/strong&gt; - Grow and develop your leadership team to capture the opportunity at hand and, in turn, develop their own teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; - Stay in close cooperation with our Regional HQ in São Paulo (BR) and global HQ in Amsterdam to ensure alignment on product demand and to embed your team in Adyen’s regional and global ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working hands-on&lt;/strong&gt; - Get hands on involved in the largest, most strategic deals, managing executive relationships and helping the team get the deal over the finish line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LATAM regional leadership&lt;/strong&gt; - become a critical member of the LATAM regional leadership team, working hand-in-hand with counterparts based on Brazil.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change management&lt;/strong&gt; - be a purposeful and empathetic change agent, embracing the ways of working within Adyen while bringing a fresh perspective on how we can operate at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
