&lt;p&gt;As the Customer Advocacy Lead, Europe, you will be responsible for elevating both Adyen’s voice and the voice of our merchants across the payments ecosystem. This role sits at the intersection of customer engagement, industry influence, and thought leadership, ensuring that Adyen is not only delivering exceptional experiences but also shaping the future of commerce alongside its customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build and lead critical advocacy initiatives, including Customer Advisory Boards, executive engagement programs, and merchant communities. By embedding customers more directly into our product innovation lifecycle and amplifying their perspectives externally, you will help position Adyen as a trusted strategic partner and industry thought leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A key focus of this role is increasing the visibility of Adyen’s deep expertise, translating it into compelling narratives, actionable insights, and influential industry participation. You will leverage Adyen’s global merchant base and scale to proactively influence partners, industry bodies, and regulatory stakeholders, ensuring both Adyen and its customers have a strong voice in shaping the future of payments.&lt;/p&gt;
