&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synthesize complex risk triggers&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., intricate ownership, shifting business models) into clear, actionable, and enforceable risk decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
