&lt;p&gt;Adyen is looking for a data-driven, proactive, and collaborative Demand Generation Manager to join our team. This role will be based in our Stockholm office and report directly to the Head of Marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Demand Generation role is focused on driving measurable impact for Adyen’s new customer acquisition efforts. In this role, you’ll be responsible for planning, executing, and optimizing targeted Account-Based Marketing (ABM) campaigns across owned channels, paid media, and events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is experienced in meeting revenue-based goals through 1:Many, 1:Few, and 1:1 ABM campaigns, collaborating closely with SDRs, Sales, and Event teams. This is a matrixed-role requiring seamless collaboration across the region and Global Marketing teams to generate sales-accepted opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-Channel ABM: Plan, set up, and optimize 1:Many, 1:Few, and 1:1 account-based marketing campaigns to drive pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event-Driven Demand Generation: Leverage both external trade shows and Adyen-owned events as core demand generation vehicles—driving targeted prospect attendance, designing pre-/post-event nurture tracks, and ensuring rigorous pipeline follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Targeting &amp;amp; Segmentation: Partner with SDRs and Sales to identify high-priority target accounts and build highly segmented lists based on market priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content &amp;amp; Messaging: Map, plan, and create compelling messages and creative tailored to prioritized accounts and specific event touch-points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital Collaboration: Collaborate closely with the Digital Marketing Manager to create effective media strategies that surround target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign Execution: Build and run regional email programs, direct marketing efforts, and optimized landing pages to convert interest into sales-accepted opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Alignment: Work closely with the Global Acquisition Marketing team to implement and scale localized strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Optimization: Leverage analytics tools to measure and determine the effectiveness of campaigns and event activations across all touch points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a B2B demand generation or integrated marketing role, with a proven track record of driving net-new customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in marketing or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with ABM and marketing automation tools; knowledge of Marketo is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with experience using data to optimize campaigns. Experience with Looker (or similar BI tools) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A healthy balance between strategic thinking and hands-on execution—you can design the plan and build it, too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile &amp;amp; Self-Motivated: A self-starting contributor with the ability to multitask, prioritize responsibilities, and navigate a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native spoken and written Swedish is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent spoken and written English is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel: Willingness and ability to travel domestically and internationally 20%+ (e.g., to support key trade shows and Adyen events).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
