&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0a1eeb2bf02c1917-23&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Developer Relations Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0a1eeb2bf02c1917-23&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;We&#39;re bui&lt;span class=&quot;citation-573 citation-574 citation-575 citation-end-575&quot;&gt;lding one of the largest payment platforms in the world — at the exact moment the ground is shifting beneath it. AI agents are increasingly discovering, evaluating, and integrating with platforms on developers&#39; behalf, and are projecte&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-573 citation-574&quot;&gt;d to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-571 citation-572 citation-573 citation-574 citation-end-574&quot;&gt; transact on payments at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-571 citation-572 citation-573 citation-end-573&quot;&gt; a scale that rivals humans. That makes Developer Relations one of the highest-impact teams at Adyen: we directly shape how both developers and their AI agents build on our platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0a1eeb2bf02c1917-24&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-568 citation-569 citation-570 citation-end-570&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make Adyen the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-568 citation-end-568&quot;&gt;easiest platform to integrate with — for humans and agents alike. We own the quality of the developer-facing content that people and agents build f&lt;/span&gt;rom (code snippets, integration examples, documentation quality), we surface developer friction with evidence and drive fixes across the company, and we&#39;re making Adyen&#39;s developer surfaces agent-legible and agent-reliable as an explicit quality bar. We&#39;re a small, senior, high-ownership team, which means a strong hire genuinely shapes the function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Developer Advocate to join the team, and contribute to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Building the source material developers and agents rely on&lt;/strong&gt; — high-quality, discoverable integration examples and code snippets across languages, at the bar our strategy demands. This is the foundation both human developers and AI agents build from, so quality, correctness, and discoverability matter more than volume — and keeping it current is part of the job, because stale content misleads agents as much as people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Making Adyen agent-ready&lt;/strong&gt; — helping ensure our docs, snippets, and developer surfaces are legible and reliable for AI agents and AI-assisted developer workflows. As agents increasingly integrate on developers&#39; behalf, this is one of the most consequential shifts in our industry, and you will help lead this transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will advocate for developers (and AI agents) internally by identifying friction points and driving cross-functional improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will create high-quality technical content, including integration guides, sample apps, and code snippets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will collaborate closely with product and engineering teams to ensure our APIs and tools are intuitive and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will engage with the developer community, representing Adyen at events, conferences, and online forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will champion documentation quality and surface developer friction with actionable evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
