&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Marketing Lead, APAC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced and data-driven &lt;strong&gt;Digital Marketing Lead, APAC&lt;/strong&gt; to join our regional team in Singapore. Reporting directly to the VP of Marketing, APAC, you will own and elevate the end-to-end digital marketing strategy across Australia, India, Southeast Asia, Hong Kong, and Japan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will bridge high-level regional growth strategies with hands-on digital execution. This role will lead digital experience across the entire customer lifecycle while focusing heavily on net-new customer acquisition through paid, earned, and owned channel performance across the APAC region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a commercial conduit and trusted team leader, you will partner closely with local country marketers, global digital marketing leaders and regional commercial leaders. This is a player-coach role where you will not only coach&amp;nbsp; and grow a high-performing digital marketing function but also be comfortable to roll up your sleeves to get into details and execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a respected and trusted leader with experience in coaching and developing teams to perform at their best capacity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Regional Strategy &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Full-Funnel Digital Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Formulate, execute, and evaluate a multi-market web and digital marketing strategy across APAC to build brand awareness, acquire new customers, and drive revenue impact across target verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a bridge between regional commercial leadership, country marketing teams, and global digital/acquisition hubs to ensure regional campaigns align with local market realities and pipeline goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate directly with the VP of Marketing, APAC on spends and ROI forecasting, and high-impact strategic projects across the broader marketing organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, coach and guide local and regional digital marketers. Set clear goals, foster individual career growth, and drive organizational alignment around shared business metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Execution &amp;amp; Media Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acquisition &amp;amp; Pipeline Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the planning, setup, and optimization of integrated demand generation campaigns (Search/SEM, Paid Social, Display, Programmatic, Content Syndication) to deliver qualified Sales Accepted Opportunities (SAOs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Search &amp;amp; LLM Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive search strategy across regional markets, maintaining a forward-looking approach to search trends, user behavior, and modern AI/LLM discovery engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web &amp;amp; Localization Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead regional web strategy—including local landing page creation, web copy translation, user experience optimization, and web personalization across APAC sub-regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency &amp;amp; Vendor Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct agency partners and media buyers across APAC. Manage campaign briefings, media plan evaluations, agency output, direct publisher deals, and ongoing execution quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics, Budget &amp;amp; ROI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Allocation: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage, and continuously optimize quarterly and annual digital marketing spend across APAC markets to ensure maximum return on investment (ROI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage analytics platforms (e.g., GA4, Salesforce, Marketo, Looker) to track campaign efficacy, model multi-channel attribution, and extract actionable insights for rapid continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of total experience in B2B digital marketing with a deep emphasis on net-new customer acquisition. Fintech or B2B tech experience is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;5+ years of team leadership experience, with a proven track record of developing multi-market, regional teams in APAC (e.g., Australia, SEA, Japan, India)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balanced Skillset:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to seamlessly balance strategic leadership with hands-on technical execution—from defining high-level commercial objectives to auditing campaign architecture and conversion flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Analytics Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on mastery of full-funnel digital tactics (SEO/SEM, LLM search, Paid Social, Programmatic) and modern martech/analytics tools (GA4, Salesforce, Marketo, Looker)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong business acumen with demonstrated success partnering with Commercial/Sales functions and tracking success against revenue-based goals (SAOs, Pipeline, ROI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Evidence of cultivating a test-and-learn culture that balances strategic vision with operational execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience managing regional digital agencies, media budgets, contract negotiations, and external partner performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 20%+ of the time across APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
