&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager - Infrastructure Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Engineering Manager to lead our Adyen Cloud Services (ACS) Team within the Platform Engineering organization in Bengaluru. This team owns and operates Adyen&#39;s core container orchestration and traffic management infrastructure, the foundation that keeps our global payment platform running. In this role, you will drive technical strategy, build a high-performing team, and shape the evolution of our platform as Adyen continues to scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;
