&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrate platform best practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure reliability, security, and observability are embedded into how teams consume infrastructure offering a &quot;golden path&quot; for engineers to deploy and operate services.&lt;/li&gt;
