&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced engineering leader:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record managing and growing high-performing teams in platform, infrastructure, or SRE domains. 8+ years in engineering, with 3+ years in leadership roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
