&lt;li&gt;Strong experience and knowledge of the payments ecosystem / PSPs / acquiring or related businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding and strong network within the Chinese cross-border / outbound merchant ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong plus if you possess deep market insights or specialized localization expertise in a specific overseas region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a team player who enjoys working in-person with teams both locally and globally across different cultures, roles, and offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an analytical, strategic negotiator with a commercially driven, go-getting attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an excellent communicator of big ideas and can uncover complex needs internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a resourceful, super self-starter and can execute and manage time-sensitive tasks in a fast-paced, highly entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
