&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based out of our San Francisco or Chicago office.&lt;/strong&gt; We’re an office-first company that offers flexibility to work from home up to two days per week. We value in-person collaboration and &lt;strong&gt;do not offer remote-only roles&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
