&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is Adyen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adyen provides payments, data, and financial products in a single solution for customers like Facebook, Uber, H&amp;amp;M, and Microsoft - making us the financial technology platform of choice. At Adyen, everything we do is engineered for ambition.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For our teams, we create an environment with opportunities for our people to succeed, backed by the culture and support to ensure they can truly own their careers. We are motivated individuals who tackle unique technical challenges at scale and solve them as a team. Together, we deliver innovative and ethical solutions that help businesses achieve their ambitions faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Head of AI Support Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adyen is making a decisive move: we are deploying Fin.ai as our primary AI support agent to resolve merchant and partner queries faster, smarter, and at scale while freeing our world-class support engineers to focus on the most complex, high-value challenges our customers face.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare, zero-to-scale leadership role. You will be the product and operational owner of Fin.ai at Adyen responsible for taking our deployment from launch to best-in-class resolution rates across all support channels. You will own the roadmap, the team, the data, and ultimately the outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fin.ai currently handles AI-assisted support for thousands of enterprise customers globally. At Adyen&#39;s scale and complexity, hitting industry-leading resolution rates demands deep domain knowledge, relentless iteration, and a leader who can bridge the gap between AI capability and real-world support operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the VP of Support and work closely with Product and Engineering to continuously push the ceiling on what Fin.ai can resolve autonomously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Product Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the multi-year vision for Fin.ai at Adyen, from pilot to autonomous end-to-end resolution of complex merchant queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product roadmap: procedure design, action integrations, escalation logic, knowledge-base quality, and channel expansion (chat, email, API).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the business case for AI investment and present results to senior leadership and the board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore, understand, contextualize and prioritize new areas of work to automate and features to implement as the Fin and broader AI toolset for Support matures and advances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Resolution Rate &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive true resolution rate (not deflection) as the primary north-star metric, tracking reopen rates, CSAT, first-contact resolution and human agent experience in parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and own a continuous improvement flywheel: conversation review, failure taxonomy, procedure updates, gold standard definition, evals approach, simulation testing, and re-deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set quality standards appropriate for a regulated payments environment, ensuring every resolution is auditable and compliant and offers a highly merchant-centric and customizable support experience vs. one size fits all&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a small, high-impact team of AI Support Specialists, Conversation Designers and build AI content expertise and a scalable process for continuous improvement and real-time feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of experimentation: run structured A/B tests on prompts, procedures, and escalation thresholds; kill what doesn&#39;t work fast. Find ways to experiment and innovate in a compliance-focused global merchant-serving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the internal expert and advocate for AI support capability, educating stakeholders across Support, Legal, Compliance, and Product. Build successful business cases for extensive AI investment and deployment.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-functional Execution&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Adyen&#39;s support engineers to identify high-volume, automatable query categories and convert them into Fin procedures that achieve high resolution rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering and Data Science to integrate Adyen&#39;s internal tooling, APIs, and knowledge systems into Fin&#39;s action layer. Focus on delivering on agentic AI for support that makes decisions within defined guardrails, and complete multi-step work across systems, and delivers end to end case resolution that feels targeted and effortless to merchants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Fin.ai on product roadmap alignment, beta features, and escalation of platform issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Risk&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Fin.ai operates within Adyen&#39;s global compliance framework — PCI-DSS, GDPR, financial services regulations — with full audit trails on every autonomous action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain guardrails for sensitive query types (disputes, fraud, regulatory) where human review remains mandatory.&amp;nbsp; Build compliance into the automation strategy and leave flexibility for an evolving global regulatory environment.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in product management, support operations, or AI/automation leadership, with at least 2 years owning an AI or conversational AI fully agentic product in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of improving resolution rates for a large-scale support operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated industry — fintech, payments, banking, or comparable — with a working understanding of compliance constraints on AI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and lead small, high-performing teams in ambiguous, fast-moving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data fluency: comfortable owning a KPI dashboard, running cohort analyses, and making prioritisation decisions from conversation-level data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Fin.ai, Zendesk AI, Salesforce Agentforce, Decagon, Sierra, or comparable agentic support platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with payment processing, acquiring, or merchant support at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or operating within a CSAT-protected AI rollout — where high quality and automation are treated as co-equal goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to LLM-based tooling, prompt engineering, or retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) in an operational context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Adyen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to step into a senior leadership role at a global fintech company at a pivotal point in its growth journey. You’ll lead a strong team that’s ready for its next evolution—and help define what best-in-class technical support looks like for the Americas region. You’ll have exposure to global strategy, world-class customers, and the chance to shape how support scales across one of Adyen’s most important markets.&lt;/p&gt;
