&lt;li&gt;Experience with designing and implementing internal control frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical thinking skills and eagerness to solve challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to operate comfortably and independently within a global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to work in an innovative technology company within the financial sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in an unstructured, fast-paced environment, challenging the status-quo and a ‘can-do’ mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
