&lt;p&gt;We know companies handle different definitions for their data-related positions, this is for instance dependent on the size of a company. We categorized and defined all our positions. Have a look at&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.adyen.com/knowledge-hub/roles-scaling-up-data-culture&quot;&gt; this blogpost&lt;/a&gt; to find out!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
