&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimization Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Optimization Data Analyst&amp;nbsp;to play a critical role in driving scalable optimizations and advanced analytics across Adyen’s global Performance Optimization team. As a mid-level analyst, you will independently lead complex analyses, support automation and experimentation projects, and collaborate with commercial and product stakeholders to deliver actionable insights that maximize merchant growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an experienced analyst looking to deepen technical impact while influencing product and business outcomes at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
