&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze large-scale payment datasets to identify performance trends, uncover optimization opportunities, and deliver high-impact recommendations to our biggest customers, while identifying and driving scalable opportunities that benefit the broader merchant base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scalable Tooling &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and build scalable analytics solutions, automation pipelines, and self-service tools that empower internal teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product, Data, and Commercial teams to translate business challenges into analytical solutions, driving continuous platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Problem-Solving &amp;amp; Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex A/B testing and data investigations, shaping data-driven strategies and validating hypotheses with analytical rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Data Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive strategic discussions by synthesizing complex data into compelling narratives, tailoring insights for technical and non-technical audiences, and positioning the Performance Optimization team as a key business enabler.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Best Practices&lt;/strong&gt;: Support knowledge-sharing within the Performance Optimization team, contributing to the elevation of analytical standards and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
