&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of relevant experience in a data analytics, data science, or similar role, ideally in fintech, payments, or a high-growth tech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Python, SQL, and PySpark, with hands-on experience in large-scale data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design and develop efficient and scalable ETL and data pipelines for datasets, including the use of data validations to ensure reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with big data tools (Spark, Airflow) and version control using Git.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with data visualization tools (e.g., Looker, Tableau) and dashboard development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of statistics, hypothesis testing, and data mining.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence product and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, self-directed, and able to manage multiple priorities in a dynamic, global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
