&lt;p&gt;Adyen is looking for a strategic, hands-on and creative PR manager. This role will work from our Tokyo office and report directly to the Head of PR &amp;amp; Communications, APAC.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a strong background in PR and communications, a deep understanding of the tech industry, and is experienced in balancing strategic and hands-on work to create earned impact.&lt;/p&gt;
