&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with the company&#39;s strategic direction across all of Japan’s external communications channels to ensure consistent messaging and positive brand positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Japan marketing and business leads to enhance efforts to generate favorable opinion about the market in the region, and garner local and regional media attention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with global and regional communications teams to ensure coordinated, accurate, consistent and effective content and messages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and own key media relationships in Japan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and direct our local PR agency partner, ensuring alignment on KPIs, strategy execution, and ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-manage our social media presence in relevant Japanese portals, and work with the marketing team to establish a social media calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the local marketing team to amplify Japan events, product launches, and brand campaigns across earned and owned channels.&lt;/li&gt;
