&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are qualified as a lawyer in Australia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong written and oral communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong research, statutory interpretation and organisation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate ability to conduct analysis of policy issues&lt;/li&gt;
