&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You think beyond individual assets and understand how content drives business outcomes. You can connect content initiatives to broader marketing and commercial goals, identify opportunities, and prioritize where to play.&lt;/li&gt;
