&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video storytelling experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You have experience shaping compelling video content — from developing narratives to crafting strong hooks that capture attention early. You understand what works in short-form, platform-first video and can partner effectively with creative teams to bring ideas to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media and content ecosystem fluency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You have a deep understanding of the evolving media landscape and how B2B audiences consume content across platforms — from long-form reports to short-form, social-first, and video-led formats — and know how to adapt content accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master storyteller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You have strong editorial judgment and a journalistic mindset. You know how to find the angle, simplify complexity, and turn technical topics into clear, compelling, and differentiated stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audience-centric&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You are deeply curious about your audience. You actively seek to understand the motivations, behaviors, and pain points of merchants across industries, and use these insights to create relevant and high-impact content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong owner and collaborator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You thrive in a fast-paced, flat environment and take full ownership of your work. You’re comfortable working independently while also influencing stakeholders and collaborating across teams, agencies, and freelancers to raise the bar on output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You have strong project management instincts and a proven ability to manage multiple priorities, meet deadlines, and deliver consistently high-quality work while remaining open to iteration and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
