&lt;li&gt;Occasional legal research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and/or deliver training programs for managers and employees on topics including respectful workplace conduct, ethical behavior, and effective complaint resolution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to Adyen’s Raise It culture.&lt;/li&gt;
