&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a proactive and adaptable Senior Account Manager to join our team in New York. The ideal candidate is a strategic thinker with a hands-on mentality; someone who is eager to help the world’s biggest brands grow while changing an industry. You are excited to work with a global, multicultural team in a collaborative manner and help your team succeed. Your focus will be on delivering an outstanding customer experience, finding new opportunities, and driving mutual success for Adyen and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
