&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Vertical Strategy Manager - Travel &amp;amp; Mobility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team TLDR: &lt;/strong&gt;Own customer strategy; lead the way on where we play, how we win and who we win with in a vertical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Travel &amp;amp; Mobility vertical is one of the key drivers of Adyen’s business where we have seen success with businesses like Uber, Tesla, Sixt, Booking.com and KLM in the Enterprise space. The key to our success is partnering closely with our customers to identify their needs, support their growth and drive success for the Travel &amp;amp; Mobility vertical. We define Travel &amp;amp; Mobility as any business operating across Airlines, Online Travel Agencies, Ride-Hailing, Car Rental, Automotive &amp;amp; EV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are particularly interested in candidates from the Mobility part of the vertical - Ride-hailing, Rental, Automotive &amp;amp; EV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
