&lt;p&gt;As Senior Vertical Strategy Manager you will play a critical role in our success by driving the commercial direction and revenue growth initiatives for net new business acquisition as well as growth of existing customers within the Travel &amp;amp; Mobility vertical.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a strong background in payments and financial technology services, combined with deep industry expertise across one or more of the following sectors: airlines, online travel agencies, shared mobility, and automotive.. They should also have exceptional strategic thinking abilities, acute analytical depth and a proven track record of driving commercial success.&lt;/p&gt;
