&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Record in Banking Infrastructure: &lt;/strong&gt;You have experience launching and scaling transactional banking products and have in-depth experience with at least one major market infrastructure (e.g., a clearing house, real-time payment rail, or banking scheme).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinker with a Hands-on Mentality: &lt;/strong&gt;A self-starter with proven organizational and commercial strength. You have excellent project management skills and the ability to lead time-sensitive, cross-functional initiatives in a fast-paced environment with little supervision. You are able to challenge the status quo.&lt;/li&gt;
