&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager, Global Acquiring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Adyen&#39;s Global Acquiring team powers the core card payment infrastructure behind billions of transactions worldwide. Through our direct connections with Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, Diners Club, JCB, and China UnionPay, we enable merchants to accept payments globally with industry-leading reliability, performance, and innovation.&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Product Manager, you will own the strategy and roadmap for critical parts of our global acquiring platform. You&#39;ll build the products that improve authorization rates, maximize merchant conversion, strengthen platform reliability, and enable Adyen to launch new payment capabilities and expand into new markets.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work at the intersection of engineering, payment networks, partnerships, commercial teams, compliance, and operations to transform the complex payments industry into scalable innovative platform capabilities that benefit every Adyen merchant. Your work will shape how millions of payments are processed every day while ensuring our platform remains the most reliable and innovative acquiring solution in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
