&lt;li&gt;Define and own the product strategy and roadmap for a critical area of Adyen&#39;s Global Acquiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable acquiring capabilities that improve payment performance, increase authorization rates, and maximize merchant conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with Visa, Mastercard, American Express and other global payment networks to influence roadmaps, implement new capabilities, and ensure ongoing compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive complex cross-functional initiatives across Engineering, Partnerships, Commercial, Compliance, Operations and Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate changing scheme requirements into scalable platform capabilities rather than one-off merchant solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to identify opportunities that improve merchant performance, operational efficiency, and platform scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead difficult product decisions through influence, aligning stakeholders across multiple organizations without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other product managers and contribute to raising the overall quality of product management within the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
