&lt;li&gt;You have domain knowledge in Payments or Fintech; preferably with knowledge of card acquiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have successfully led highly cross-functional initiatives involving engineering, commercial teams, partnerships, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
