&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager who is passionate about driving the end-to-end testing experience for Adyen&#39;s global merchant base. Your team sits at the crossroads of quality of merchant’s integrations with Adyen, pre-live signaling, and testing capabilities and ensures that every merchant can validate their integration with confidence before going live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, your primary focus will be on payments simulation, a deeply complex domain spanning hundreds of payment methods across global markets, each with unique flows and behaviors. However, the scope of this role will rapidly expand to defining the product strategy for a holistic testing suite covering the entire Adyen platform covering not only payments but also Financial products, Uplift, Loyalty, Giving etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You aren&#39;t just building test tooling; you are transforming a fragmented testing environment into a seamless, unified platform that gives merchants confidence to go live, faster and with higher quality integrations. Your mission spans the full testing lifecycle: from simulators and automated go-live validation to developer sandboxes, debugging tools, and AI-ready test suites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define how merchants get confidence to go live on Adyen. Drive testability, accelerated feedback loops, and prescriptive guidance delivered through tools that are as useful to AI coding agents as they are to human developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Payments Simulation:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the simulation platform that enables merchants to test payment flows end-to-end without requiring live connections. Navigate the inherent complexity of global payment methods, balancing coverage breadth with per-method accuracy across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand Beyond Payments:&lt;/strong&gt; Extend testing capabilities so merchants can validate their full integration — not just payments, but across financial products, Uplift, Loyalty, and Giving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Adoption Across Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Influence multiple product teams across regions to contribute to and adopt shared testing infrastructure. Align stakeholders from engineering, operations, and commercial teams around shared outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consolidate and Simplify:&lt;/strong&gt; Unify a fragmented landscape of testing tools into a coherent, self-service experience. Lead deprecation of legacy solutions with clear timelines and merchant communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer AI-Native Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape how AI agents and automated tools interact with our testing infrastructure. Ensure our platform is machine-readable and developer-tooling friendly, enabling the next generation of integration workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Full Testing Journey:&lt;/strong&gt; Progressively deliver automated go-live validation, on-demand developer sandboxes, and workflow guidance that takes merchants from sign-up to production with minimal friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
