&lt;li&gt;Own the entire recruitment cycle, from pinpointing essential talent gaps to managing candidate pipeline and closing offers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry trends to enhance sourcing strategies while fostering an inclusive hiring process that values diverse perspectives;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with stakeholders to make data-driven hiring decisions and supporting smooth onboarding and integration of new hires;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
