&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a minimum of 6 years experience in Recruitment (full-cycle);&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about Commercial Recruitment with an understanding of the (fin)tech landscape and candidate market;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize analytics to inform hiring strategies and improve recruitment outcomes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly self-motivated with the ability to define structure and prioritize tasks effectively;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of hiring for Commercial functions in EMEA; experience working with Marketing roles is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with international teams while adhering to European working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
