&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Full Stack Engineer for Customer Interfaces in San Francisco, you will lead the evolution of Adyen’s experience platform, building the foundational frameworks, AI-integrated guardrails, and component libraries that empower global teams to ship secure, conversational financial experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a product-minded engineer who can build end-to-end streaming, multi-modal user interfaces while architecting backend agentic workflows (specifically Tool-use, Chains, and Policy Layers). In this role, AI is not a standalone job title or a hypothetical sandbox; it is an integrated engineering capability used to transform natural language inputs into authenticated, secure financial operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Intelligent Customer Interfaces:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the next generation of UIs at Adyen, building &lt;strong&gt;Dynamic/Agentic UI components&lt;/strong&gt; in Vue/Preact that adapt in real time beyond static dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect backend integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Design performant Java services that orchestrate data pipelines and integrate with Agentic workflows to handle tool-use, chain execution, and state synchronization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the Bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Set engineering standards for the team and company. Provide mentorship through problem decomposition, research methodology, and code review. Champion reproducibility, documentation, and rigorous evaluation practices across the AI organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer Zero-Trust AI Guardrails:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect the security and policy enforcement layers for Agentic workflows, maintaining strict financial data privacy and reducing hallucinated operations from touching critical backend logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner on Product Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate directly with Product Management to identify high-impact merchant workflows, translating ambiguous merchant problems into simple, high-velocity technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Operational Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Own your code in production. Monitor live performance, minimize end-to-end streaming latency, champion security compliance, and lead root-cause analysis for live incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering AI for Production:&lt;/strong&gt; Move beyond the &quot;sandbox&quot;. Build robust evaluation frameworks, latency-optimized streaming, and observability layers that ensure AI-driven features are reliable, secure, and ready for critical financial operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of collaborating across global engineering hubs, effectively aligning remote teams on technical decisions, and driving documentation-first communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deeply proficient in Java for high-concurrency backend services, with architectural competence to integrate and support Agentic workflows (Python). Experienced with Vue/Preact for complex, stateful web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied AI Systems &amp;amp; Safety:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience (or strong architectural competence) with production-grade Agentic AI integrations, including policy layers, evaluation frameworks, RAG architectures, and deterministic execution boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security-First Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A &quot;security-by-design&quot; approach to handling sensitive financial data, user authorization, and zero-trust access in web environments.&lt;/li&gt;
