&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer (Java) - Screening Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Screening team is at the heart of this platform, providing a framework for our customers and Adyen to process transactions safely. As Adyen and our merchants scale globally, the complexity of our domain is continuously growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team operates at the critical juncture between regulatory mandate and operational scale within Adyen. We are responsible for mastering the complexities of diverse, &lt;strong&gt;global&lt;/strong&gt; regulatory frameworks, translating complex legal requirements into robust, reliable software and processes. By owning this challenging domain, we assure millions of customers that their transactions are handled through a dependable and compliant framework, allowing them to rely confidently on our platform for their financial needs worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; – Help the Screening build solutions that enable Adyen’s global growth in a compliant way. Our roadmap is diverse with solutions across backend, ML/AI and big data. You will be responsible for the entire lifecycle of your projects, from ideation to productionizing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate&lt;/strong&gt; – Our team is a pioneer in the Adyen engineering organization, as we are one of the first teams deploying GenAI-powered applications to support other functions of Adyen. This is a new development paradigm that comes with a whole set of new challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; – We rely on good collaboration in order to deliver solutions impacting several parts of Adyen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the Team Direction&lt;/strong&gt; – In our team, engineers actively shape the product roadmap and closely collaborate with the team leadership to ensure our solutions are compliant, complete and scalable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6+ years of professional experience and are currently working as a software engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in cross-functional product teams, part of a larger organization, is a big plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our tech stack revolves around java, so being proficient in Java is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team works across backend and big data. You should be able to comfortably design and productionize cross-stack solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to coach other engineers and bring a mindset of learning and curiosity to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good understanding of industry-standard engineering practices is a must.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent communication skills and the ability to articulate complex technical concepts in front of different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to drive a team’s roadmap in close collaboration with the product and engineering leadership of the team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
