&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated knowledge of building Java based web services (RESTful, SOAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in designing performant database models in PostgreSQL or other relational database)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable of various software architecture paradigms such as event-driven or message queueing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
