&lt;h3&gt;Strategic Pricing Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Strategic Pricing Partner for the LATAM region to join our Global Commercial Pricing &amp;amp; Monetization team. As a Strategic Pricing Analyst you will work closely with different teams (e.g. sales, account management, product management, and finance) to ensure we set the best possible prices that reflect our premium offering. The ideal candidate is someone who is able to approach complex problems in a structured manner and convert them into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be part of our Global Commercial Pricing &amp;amp; Monetization team (as part of the Finance department) which develops value-based pricing and monetization strategies for Adyen’s product offering and provides price guidance to the commercial organization. In addition, we enable the commercial teams to create the best commercial pricing proposals by providing them with means such as tools, insights and training. Finally, we monitor price developments and identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement pricing strategies for local (LATAM) markets, products and payment methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement monetization strategies for new local products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional leadership to develop and translate pricing insights into actions and decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with key regional stakeholders to understand business needs and challenges, and convert these into new pricing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of global pricing tools and solutions within the region, while channeling regional feedback to inform future global developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide deal pricing support on the region’s most strategic and high-value deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the regional pricing expert and serve as the first point of contact for regional pricing questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Together with other regional experts, you will collaborate on cross functional initiatives that are important to LATAM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have relevant experience in (B2B) pricing, preferably in a strategic, consultancy or other analytical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong quantitative and detail-oriented background with excellent analytical and modeling skills. Proficiency in tools such as SQL and Looker is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You convert data insights into actions and tangible output such as optimized pricing strategies, processes, tools, or trainings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an entrepreneurial mindset and the ability to work in a high pace environment where you need to continuously prioritize your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an effective communicator and can build your own network in a global company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience delivering projects end-to-end, from concept through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English is a must. Speaking Spanish is a plus. You will work alongside global peers and need to have the ability to operate comfortably within a global and multicultural environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Diversity, Equity and Inclusion commitments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our unique approach is a product of our diverse perspectives. This diversity of backgrounds and cultures is essential in helping us maintain our momentum. Our business and technical challenges are unique, and we need as many different voices as possible to join us in solving them - voices like yours. No matter who you are or where you’re from, we welcome you to be your true self at Adyen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
