&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in managing teams and building executive level enterprise relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience in account management, business development, consulting, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in enterprise payments and financial services and/or working within a SaaS platform or marketplace environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
