&lt;p&gt;Adyen is looking for an experienced and motivated leader to join our Professional Services Team to lead a team of Implementation Engineers in North America. You will join a group of peers to propel our Implementation Team to new heights, setting the standard in the industry. This position is based out of our Chicago office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Implementation Engineering team supports our large and strategic customers in solution design, integrating and going live in the quickest and most sustainable way possible, with use of comprehensive product knowledge. Implementation Engineers work on innovative complex projects ranging from Online payments integrations, In-Person Payments (IPP), Marketplaces, Card issuing programs and Financial Services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
