&lt;li&gt;Create an inspiring and collaborative team environment with an open communication and feedback culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaling up the team while preserving the Adyen formula and ensuring our unique culture is fostered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambassador of change; help lead the charge of new initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement, understanding what works today and leveraging ideas and insights to make the process better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross functionality and drive initiatives to develop the (global) IM organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define and execute strategic initiatives with the goal of advancing our function&#39;s OKRs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
