&lt;li&gt;Experienced with integration projects within a large global company working in professional services, finance, retail or general technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of helping to drive global process change, setting up tools and procedures so that Adyen continues to be successful from an operational perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the dynamics of working in a global organization. Able to develop effective relationships with global teams to collaborate on projects, adapting to international time constraints where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of the challenges of global commerce and the various components and dependencies that are required for a client to be successful across different regions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
