&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Set clear individual and team goals, delegate tasks effectively, and manage performance using Adyen’s leadership framework: Empower, Care, Act, Scale.&lt;/li&gt;
