&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively identify opportunities to eliminate toil by automating repetitive tasks and continuously improving internal IT systems and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
