&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience leading and developing high-performing software engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong software engineering background building large-scale, distributed systems in Java or similar backend technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy coaching engineers through technical mentorship, regular feedback, and career development.&lt;/li&gt;
